{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以按程備儀，師兼程而進，故致有失。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十九頁"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十九頁"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "分六小目"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十八頁"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十一頁"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十九頁"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十一頁"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十五頁"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十一頁"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初星野，次圖說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同界"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自峨眉縣出南門，至正頂，計程百二十里。凡山路、水道、寺宇、峯巒、古蹟，一一縷載，燦若列眉。餘詳散圖。顧復初書，譚鍾嶽繪。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三峨，「在縣東西六十里」，「東西」二字，疑誤。但多處皆然，祇好仍之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即絕頂。金殿、祖殿後為覩光臺。以下各詩，晴峯譚鍾嶽撰。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即靈巖寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即聖積寺，樓有巨鐘。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即洗象池。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即萬年寺，有白水池。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即洪椿坪，此處多雨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即雙飛橋，有清音閣，黑、白二水，牛心石。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即仙峯寺，有九老古洞。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "淨土寺，即大坪。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即伏虎寺，有羅峯庵，蔣虎臣舊隱處。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大學士　井研"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲間"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "分六：一釋名、二修證、三德相、四法要、五利行、六應化。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見《如來不思議境界經》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如《華嚴經．如來名號品》所說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即阿彌陀佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即觀世音菩薩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即大勢至菩薩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即文殊菩薩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即普賢菩薩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上敍事係節略"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "節錄《悲華經》〈大施品〉及〈諸菩薩本受記品〉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "（〈行願品〉已完，此後另起）"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "盧遮切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上四則，見《法苑珠林．卷十\n七．普賢部》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本舊志〈志餘〉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《高僧傳三集》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《淨土聖賢錄》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《高僧傳新四集》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《高僧傳三集》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《華嚴持驗記》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《高僧傳新四集》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《高僧傳三集》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《淨土聖賢錄》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《現果隨錄》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《太平廣記》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并釋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附：峯、巖、臺、石、岡、洞、坡、坪、溪、河、溝、池、泉、井、山道、水道。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三峨，云「在縣東西六十里」，恐「東西」二字，抑係「東南」或「西南」二字之誤。舊志〈圖說〉、〈形勝〉皆作「東西」，故今亦仍之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十三峯，附四頂、三山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "頂亦峯類，故附於此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上，山以形得名，故亦附峯後。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四巖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六臺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十六石"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五岡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十二洞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六坡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十七坪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十一溪，附一潭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三河，附二水"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四溝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十池，附溫涼二泉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四泉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上\n有風洞得名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "殿後華巖坪，舊名赤城山。舊有香烟、羅漢、白雲寺，今廢。殿東北，\n即宋皇觀舊址，名道紀堂。華嚴寺賓岑，伏虎寺青龍山也。觀在龍門洞南，近神船下。左有千人洞、授道臺、軒轅觀、虛靈第七洞天。右有呂仙劍劃十字洞、瞿真仙人升仙\n石。非登頂大路，不贅。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一名白巖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從此灣內南入，左進為廣福寺，乃寶現溪。\n由寺入石筍溝、寶珠溪、天柱峯、金剛石，凡數折。後牛心寺又名臥雲，即古延福院，有白雲、青蓮二閣，乃孫真人修道處。寺左丹砂洞，遙望大峨石左，中峯寺後，即呼應峯，\n茂真尊者與真人弈棋處。有呼應庵、溫涼池。後有三仙洞、雄黃石。由寺前下坡，舊路自觀音巖、瓦廠，下至積善橋，亦可至洪椿坪。又有觀音洞、十二尖峯、白雲峽、淘米泉，\n曲行紆入，景物最佳美矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西去十里，為虎跳橋，山壁峭立，屈曲十二盤而上，有八音池、黑水寺，即唐勅修華藏寺，為一山祖庭。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即觀心坡也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從此而下五里，至九老洞，景物幽勝，但路峻險為難。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一名錯歡喜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "對門弓背山後，有觀\n音巖。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一名陵雲梯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下有伏羲、女媧、鬼谷三洞，蓋人迹罕到。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自此橫去，為通天和尚肉身塔、學士堂、普賢庵、大覺庵、中靜室。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從高橋峯下，有小剛石、覩佛臺，下有冷竹坪、蓮華峯、不到寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "閣下\n有飛來鐘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "庵下即七天橋、文殊庵，上山來路"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "庵左過嶺直下為華藏庵，東萍大師開建，今廢。錫瓦殿左，橫去為飛\n雲霞，上頂為賢首閣、千佛頂，乃伏牛僧無心所開。巖下蓬萊三島。右去為羅漢、師子、桫欏等坪。自此朝北而行，可至白龍池、大覺塔院、迴龍大路也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此處可至不到寺，由黃沙溪、冷竹坪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如從峨眉縣至靈巖，由聖積寺。青龍場以下，同前。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如從伏虎寺去，由龍門壩至龍\n門洞，從此而上有石船子，即普賢船也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後出五渡溪，有金倉寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即四峨山，明末\n沙門即宗大師建。大設戒壇，後傳衣鉢。鞠惟大師繼席，規繩至嚴，為一代首儀矣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即虎溪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即黑水寺，寺峯巒為峨山之最勝。但滄桑後，祖庭傾\n圮，有此地而不得其人，深可悲哉。凡有大沙門，此間最為勝地，可居耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "由瓦屋山路一轉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即峨頂新路，坦平，可通車馬"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音髓越嶲，郡名。越有嶲水，漢武帝元鼎間，始置郡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音沓，雜遝。又䢔遝，行相及也。䢔音合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音拂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下有闕文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大學士　井研"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四川督學　龍眠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附：堂、殿、院、樓、閣、亭、橋、坊、塔。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明萬曆間，僧妙峯募瀋王及川督等鑄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "石下即七寶臺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "州，疑指今峨眉縣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "靜室、館附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此僧另是一位，非峯頂之性天"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上七庵廢。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "庵或作安"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "水分黑白，即符文水"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡黑龍潭、寶現溪水，俱從此下，始出龍門也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一名萬度橋，有上中下三道。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "川湖總督　三韓"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四川巡撫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附塔銘，附居士。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "悟有偈贈師，載詩集"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即今圓覺庵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "海潮，即今之法雨寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "東吳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大學士"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "東吳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翰林編修"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "破山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初、歷朝勅賜，二、護法名文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名白水寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蜀王"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禮部侍郎"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "刑部員外　漹江"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正德六年辛未春三月既望"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大學士　眉山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翰林檢討"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四川提學　聊城"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內江"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四川督學　龍眠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "兵部侍郎"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四川巡道　三韓"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四川巡撫　三韓"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清"}
